<title>UK: BOE GIVES UK MONEY MARKET 50 MLN STG LATE HELP.</title>
<headline>BOE GIVES UK MONEY MARKET 50 MLN STG LATE HELP.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it provided 50 million stg of unspecified assistance through its settlement late repo facility, having revised up its forecast money market shortage to 1.4 billion stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
